{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/jp/ep7/quest_story/17218020.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17218020","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17218020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1721802001:1":{"text":"あれぇ……もう起きたの？","source_cn":"啊哈……你醒啦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE10AB3DA694FD49C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721802002:1":{"text":"きみの魂の波動……とても明るくて、力強くなってるのよ。どうやら、あの大きなやつを倒せたのね。","source_cn":"看来你战胜了那个大家伙呢。你的灵魂波动变得……唔，很亮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CD5C911F56FDE2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721802003:1":{"text":"……はい。","source_cn":"……是的，冕下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E42E70469429459","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721802004:1":{"text":"夢の中で、「本当の巨竜」に出会いました。あれは、私の弱い心だったのですね。","source_cn":"我看到了……那个所谓“真实的巨龙”，其实就是我自己内心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC97CDEC4FF179EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721802005:1":{"text":"ですが、私はそれを打ち倒しました。","source_cn":"但我已经击败了它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x315BBDA494719889","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721802006:1":{"text":"それで、今はどんな気分？","source_cn":"感觉如何？<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D68540E21E9A148","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721802007:1":{"text":"今までにないぐらい、清々しい気分です。","source_cn":"感觉……前所未有的好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA092CE178EECAEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721802008:1":{"text":"弓を握る手から迷いが消え、心のざわめきも聞こえません。自分が何をすべきなのか、はっきり分かりました。","source_cn":"握弓的手不再犹豫，心里的杂音也消失了。我现在很清楚自己...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x523C6A7AB8AFA4EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721802009:1":{"text":"アウロラ様、お力添えいただきありがとうございます。この夢の中で、弓術以上に大切なものを取り戻せました。","source_cn":"奥萝菈冕下，感谢您的援手。这场梦境让我找回了比箭术更重...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1871F0417CB74059","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721802010:1":{"text":"ふぁ……どういたしましてなのよ……","source_cn":"唔……不用谢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x641FD9D5D37B0A72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721802011:1":{"text":"それじゃあ、わたしはもうアヴァロンに戻って……寝るのよ……","source_cn":"那我也回阿瓦隆……补觉了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x407C625B088DBDD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721802012:0":{"text":"私も自分のいるべき戦場へ行かないと……さあ、駐屯地で支度を済ませたら出発よ。","source_cn":"我也该奔赴我要去的战场了……接下来，回到驻地整理行装直...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CC65574FF6884BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721802013:1":{"text":"お父様とは……戦果を上げて戻ってから会えばいいわ。","source_cn":"父亲那里……等我带着战功回来再向他致意吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BA7F7B1221409BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:奥萝菈":{"text":"アウロラ","source":"奥萝菈","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"グウィネス","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/jp/ep7/quest_story/17218030.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17218030","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17218030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1721803001:0":{"text":"先に馬に餌をやっておきましょう。そうすれば、あとですぐに出発できるわ。","source_cn":"先喂喂战马吧，待会就可以直接出发了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44FBF2D55DE1B47B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"グウィネス","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep7/quest_story/17218040.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17218040","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17218040","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1721804001:1":{"text":"ジョンさん、ストームに飼葉を倍量与えて、蹄鉄も点検しておいてください。万全の状態にしておきたいので――","source_cn":"约翰，帮我给风暴喂双份的草料，再检查一下马蹄铁。我需要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8037F23419CF7C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721804002:1":{"text":"おはようございます、お嬢様……いえ、グウィネス隊長。ご安心ください。ストームには上等な黒豆と燕麦を食べさせてあります。","source_cn":"早安，大小姐……哦不，格温妮丝队长。您不用急，风暴已经...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE503007841D23D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721804003:1":{"text":"蹄鉄も昨夜のうちに打ち替えておきました。鞍もすでにつけてあります。","source_cn":"马蹄铁昨晚刚换了新的，马鞍我也帮您装好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70471DB3233B3834","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721804004:2":{"text":"もう食べさせたのですか？今日は遠出するなんて伝えていないはずですが……","source_cn":"喂好了？我没有提前通知我要……出远门。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB743F64289EB5FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721804005:2":{"text":"グウィネスが馬に近づくと、鞍の両脇に下げられた荷袋が膨らんでいるのに気づいた。しかも予備の矢筒まで、すぐ手の届く位置に掛けられている。","source_cn":"格温妮丝走到战马旁，发现马鞍两侧的行囊