":"0xB612781E162E13C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721804011:1":{"text":"さあ、そこまでは……ただ、指揮官様は隊長のことを「その弓と同じように、そう簡単には折れない」とおっしゃっていました。","source_cn":"那我就不知道了，我只听到了司令大人说您的脾气和手里的弓...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x848B16843E486CB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721804012:1":{"text":"何を言っても聞かないのなら、何も持たせずに行かせて苦労させるより、きちんと準備を整えて送り出したほうがマシだと……","source_cn":"既然怎么拦都拦不住，与其让您赌气空着手跑出去受苦，不如...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFBB4C31569BA8AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721804013:0":{"text":"ああ、それと、「テフラスキアでは意地を張るな。どんな戦功よりも、命のほうが大事だ」と伝えるよう言われました。","source_cn":"哦，他还让我转告您——“告诉她，到了灰影郡别逞强。活着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD638C73AB1BA42C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1721804014:2":{"text":"……お父様ったら、そんな余計なことをしてくれなくても、自分の面倒くらい見られるのに。","source_cn":"……父亲也是，多此一举，我又不是不能照顾好自己。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FB219993F47E155","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1721804015:0":{"text":"左様ですとも。隊長は誰よりもしっかりしていらっしゃいます。では……どうかご無事で。","source_cn":"是是是，队长最独立了。那……祝您平平安安顺顺利利？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCC483DB3832E44C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1721804016:0":{"text":"ありがとうございます、ジョンさん。","source_cn":"多谢你，约翰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA77429102DB6517","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1721804017:1":{"text":"もう一度荷物を確認したら、出発します。","source_cn":"我最后再确认一遍行装……就离开！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x123F0C278F26BACB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"グウィネス","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:马夫约翰":{"text":"御者のジョン","source":"马夫约翰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"ナレーション","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/jp/ep7/quest_story/17218050.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17218050","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17218050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1721805001:1":{"text":"装備は万端、物資も揃っている……でも、何か足りない気がする……","source_cn":"装备齐全，补给充足……但是……总觉得少了点什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53CA3FBB28E6F93B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721805002:1":{"text":"ふと、グウィネスの脳裏に、昨日の夢で受けた試練の光景がよみがえった。闇と嘲笑に呑み込まれたあの世界で、誰もが彼女に諦